==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|jingo|ism|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈdʒɪŋɡəʊɪz(ə)m/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{label|en|uncountable}} Excessive [[patriotism]] or [[aggressive]] [[nationalism]], especially with regards to foreign policy.
# {{label|en|countable}} A jingoistic attitude, comment, etc.

